OL,3,GNEWSAHospital 'on track' as shrunken   
OL,4,Adesign plans lodged                    
OL,6,FA health trust is seeking approval to  
OL,7,Freduce the size of its new hospital by 
OL,8,Fabout 20%, as it insists it will be    
OL,9,Fcompleted on time.                     
OL,11,FCounty Durham and Darlington NHS       
OL,12,FFoundation Trust said the size of the  
OL,13,Fnew Shotley Bridge Hospital had been   
OL,14,Fscaled back from original 2023 plans   
OL,15,F"while retaining the planned range of  
OL,16,Fservices" to bring it within budget.   
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
