OL,3,GNEWSAHospital 'on track' as shrunken   
OL,4,Adesign plans lodged                    
OL,6,FThe hospital site is currently being   
OL,7,Fprepared for construction, which is    
OL,8,Fexpected to begin in September next    
OL,9,Fyear, and the trust has lodged an      
OL,10,Fapplication with Durham County Council 
OL,11,Fto alter the original designs.         
OL,13,FThe trust said the design was reviewed 
OL,14,Fover 2023 and 2024 to ensure the scheme
OL,15,Fwas affordable and deliverable within  
OL,16,Fthe national budget.                   
